  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Thesis Chair: _________________________ Signature: _________________________</p>
    <p>Committee Member: _________________________ Signature: _________________________</p>
    <p>Committee Member: _________________________ Signature: _________________________</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Student signature indicates he/she is making this request and that he/she has reviewed the <span data-field="thesis_manual_name">{{ thesis_manual_name }}</span> dissertation web site, pertinent deadlines, instructions for RT/AF and IRB submissions, and has read the thesis/dissertation manual.</p>
    <p>Master's Coordinator Approval: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="coordinator_approval_date">{{ coordinator_approval_date }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: auto;">
    <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
  </div>
